# Copy this file to .env and fill in a real value before building for
# anything other than local development against your own machine's
# backend/ server.
#
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables at BUNDLE time, not runtime — this
# must be set before `expo start` (dev) or before running
# `expo prebuild`/archiving (production), not changed afterward.
#
# Dev: safe to leave unset — src/services/apiClient.ts falls back to a
# LAN-IP default for the iOS Simulator / a physical device on the same
# network as your locally-running backend/.
#
# Production / Xcode Archive / TestFlight / App Store builds: REQUIRED.
# There is no production fallback — an unset value here fails loudly
# (console.error + every network call rejects) rather than silently
# shipping pointed at a developer's own machine. Set this to your
# deployed backend/'s real HTTPS URL.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
